      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `8e7e0a59839da81cb63f8c05a444e545eecb85a39f980af46e674ace0c843578--4.-Aboriginal-and-Torres-Strait-Islander-victims-of-crime-selected-states-and-territories-Tables-23-to-28-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2024\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | b2f688c2a3bb614c896a439efb3881025e2c511984f5f65fb689331eef682839 | missing |\n| \"Table 23\" | 891b678e6a8458594a61235d8ce3eeb25013323ec6f569c0f790d7e3aa04034c | missing |\n| \"Table 24\" | ce38606ec6e1fbdac54502a34f38051237cfa67e71494009a90b09b9649199f1 | missing |\n| \"Table 25\" | ced0d0188636f7b8036fd80f7482352e844247dd8dd098cb9d437dc94a492fdf | missing |\n| \"Table 26\" | e708966fe281f85a98940b1e3e7c17f84eea1cf6c5074ea3a8adca0ea64dafae | missing |\n| \"Table 27\" | 9dc572b41e536bb24032e0f1e8800e554225a8ece2bb48958b5ddabd58a71761 | missing |\n| \"Table 28\" | 47800b265b221fa8825d4b3ca7f0dc1c80e0f46a5ae2e6d6b00ac7639d4e7e95 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
